Capture by address: collect(&last, d, e) stores the error of a dynamic
call through the pointer. Under Go semantics the set is drivers.ErrFile.
By design (e2e dynamic/freevar_addr_passed) a variable whose address is
passed on is unresolved(memory): expected exactly that one entry.
-- args --
dispatch/funcs.go:@byaddr
